  "title": "Backup restore follows symlinks in uploaded archives",
  "summary": "### Impact\r\nAn admin restoring a crafted backup can read and write files outside the restore directory, as the user running Discourse. This can lead to code execution on the server. Only sites with `allow_restore` enabled are affected.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nKeep `allow_restore` disabled, and only restore backups from trusted sources.\r\n\nDiscovered by Anthropic's OSS Scanner, as vulnerability ANT-2026-AWV304MJ.",
